Mutant (e), test-only: keep the forged reward. A file the agent writes into
/logs/verifier/ before the verifier runs survives into grading, because all
three clean-up sites that would remove it are skipped: harden_before_verify's
clear (lockdown.py), Verifier._clear_output_dir's own clear, and
Verifier.verify's unlink of the host-bound reward files (verifier_core.py).
The first patch skipped only the first, so the other two still removed the
forged file and the mutant was inert (DT2-F1).

